              "<span id=\"cb1-100\"><a href=\"#cb1-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"ss\">- </span>**median rna read count:** Median of RNA read count for oligos that passed filtering to determine sufficient coverage in terms of read count. Value is the median of all replicates.</span>\n",
