              "<span id=\"cb1-102\"><a href=\"#cb1-102\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"ss\">- </span>**pearson correlation:** The correlation of log2 RNA/DNA ratios across tested sequences as a measure of replicable activity signal. Value is the median of replicate comparisons using only oligos with &gt;= <span class=\"in\">`{python} thresh`</span> barcodes.</span>\n",
